--[[
  UnboxingGap v1.0.0 - complementary read-only measurer for Delta (mobile or desktop). Plain Lua syntax (no +=, continue, //).
  Fills what the Ultra Collector did not get: menu panels, per-action economy ledger, box health/reward sessions, map with rotation, board texts.
  Writes numbers and texts only. It NEVER reads or stores asset ids (Image, MeshId, TextureId, SoundId, AnimationId), never reads script source,
  never calls a RemoteEvent/RemoteFunction, never buys, attacks, hatches or rebirths for you, and never modifies game objects.
  Output: workspace/UnboxingGap/<session>/*.json (read back and compared after writing). Without writefile: UBG| lines in the console.
]]

